OL,3,GNEWSAMan appears in court on attempted
OL,4,Amurder charge
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 43-year-old man has appeared in court
OL,7,Fcharged with attempted murder after a
OL,8,Fman in his 70s was found with serious
OL,9,Finjuries.
OL,11,FDaniel Kent, of Broad Lane, Sutterton,
OL,12,Fnear Boston, appeared at Lincoln
OL,13,FMagistrates' Court on Wednesday.
OL,15,FNo pleas were entered and Kent was
OL,16,Fremanded in custody until a hearing at
OL,17,FLincoln Crown Court, which has been set
OL,18,Ffor 25 November.
OL,20,FThe charge relates to an incident in
OL,21,FKirkby on Bain, near Horncastle, on
OL,22,FSaturday.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
